Package: Applr
Title: Visualize and Explain Linear Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Cameron", "McClellan", , "cameron.m.mcclellan@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("James", "Beeson", , "jamesbeeson01@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Tools for visualizing and explaining linear models fit with lm().
    Draws 2D slices of higher-dimensional models in base graphics and as a
    ggplot2 layer, offers an interactive 3D scatter with a fitted surface for
    two-predictor models, and renders model equations as plain text or LaTeX.
